 possible to put assets to work, access liquidity against them, and use them in daily life from the same platform.\r\n\r\nStake provides access to Ethereum staking while keeping positions liquid and usable. Liquid automates onchain strategies designed to generate variable yield across eligible assets. Cash supports card spending and payments. Trading, transfers, and collateralized borrowing bring additional flexibility, giving users more ways to manage and use their wealth without first selling their holdings.\r\n\r\nWith more than $3 billion in assets across the platform, ether.fi combines the technical foundation of a leading DeFi protocol with the simplicity and utility of a modern fintech platform. The result is a financial home for modern wealth: one place to grow it, move it, borrow against it, and use it—while remaining in control."}}}},{"item":{"id":"vethor-token","coin_id":5230,"name":"VeThor","symbol":"VTHO","market_cap_rank":386,"thumb":"https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/5230/standard/VTHO_Circle_Crop__Reference_.png?1751980206","small":"https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/5230/small/VTHO_Circle_Crop__Reference_.png?1751980206","large":"https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/5230/large/VTHO_Circle_Crop__Reference_.png?1751980206","slug":"vethor-token","price_btc":7.945191983710298e-09,"score":14,"data":{"price":0.0006128343771979049,"price_btc":"0.000000007945191983710298","price_change_percentage_24h":{"aed":40.809835502135726,"ars":40.70191441725831,"aud":41.96338596010244,"bch":60.692137827754465,"bdt":41.36337637618579,"bhd":40.85166205451933,"bits":43.47184414949978,"bmd":40.809835502135726,"bnb":46.561501522294414,"brl":40.81535507547673,"btc":43.47184414949979,"cad":41.04386394817222,"chf":41.32656469477417,"clp":42.98451064382557,"cny":40.80983550213574,"czk":40.93060305685157,"dkk":41.04701487475078,"dot":44.56874701178529,"eos":48.096292384405245,"eth":42.61724654419382,"eur":41.0482654344345,"gbp":41.211510586834